// alea, one feature at a time · 04 — Transforms
// Move it, turn it, tile it, mirror it: one shape (a square with a circle at
// its corner) through move, rotate, tile, mirror, kaleidoscope and warp, the
// original ghosted in grey behind each result. Each result is the very
// expression on screen, applied to the whole canvas and placed in its frame.
// Generated by series/gen.py from series/04-transforms.json; the template is the
// generator, the episode is the JSON.

